I suppose FirstOrDefault could be used here.

Your implementation incorrectly handles removals and tags. Here's an example with cloning
```C#	
			var field = chromeNode.ChildrenMatching("Button").FirstOrDefault();
			if (field != null)
			{
				field.RenameKey("TabButton");
				var otherField = field.Clone();
				otherField.RenameKey("ArrowButton");
				chromeNode.AddNode(otherField);
			}
```
